  "description": "An ETC ColorSource Spot V, a single cylindrical stage fixture roughly 0.34 by 0.60 by 0.34 m. A U-shaped bail sits above the body, turning on a vertical pan hinge and carrying the head on a horizontal tilt hinge. Both are manual aim adjustments with no DMX control. The barrel carries a manual zoom ring, a focus knob and a gobo holder, with no gobo wheel. A flat circular lens disc, roughly 11.8 units across, fills the front. Behind it sits one multi-colour LED engine (red, green, blue, indigo, lime, CCT), making a single emitter cell with one shared dimmer. Heatsink fins probably line the rear underside, and a removable shutter barrel with blades fits the front.",
